# IdeaForge skill gates

Before implementing any feature:

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and the phase in `IDEA_DISCOVERY_ENGINE_ROADMAP.md`
2. Read the matching skill from `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-07-ideaforge-complete-product-plan.md`
3. Do not scaffold Phase 1 features (auth, Stripe, wizard) without reading `adding-auth`, `adding-stripe`, `tk-nextjs`

## Phase → skill quick reference

| Work area | Skills |
|-----------|--------|
| LangGraph / scoring | `langchain-architecture`, `ai-fallback-chain`, `ws-llm-application-dev` |
| Python pipeline | `ws-python-development`, `test-driven-development` |
| Postgres | `ws-database-design`, `tk-postgresql` |
| Docker / local dev | `adding-docker` |
| CI | `setting-up-ci`, `ws-cicd-automation` |
| Next.js UI | `tk-nextjs`, `tk-shadcn-ui`, `ws-frontend-development` |
| Landing / copy | `prod-landing-page`, `mkt-copywriting` |
| Email (AgentMail) | `docs/AGENTMAIL.md` — NOT outdated `open-source-skills/.../agentmail` |
| Done claims | `verification-before-completion` |

